date: 2026-08-09
categories: [biochemistry, geochemistry]
tags: [biochemistry, geochemistry, climate-change, biogeochemical-cycles, earth-science, carbon-cycle]
excerpt: "A biogeochemical review that uses water, fire, and wind as an organizing frame for the coupled cycles of geochemistry, chemistry, and biochemistry -- from hydrogen bonds to the carbon cycle, rock weathering, and climate change."
